Value Required,Filldown SERVICE_INSTANCE (.+?)
Value Filldown PEER (\S+)
Value Filldown VCID (\S+)
Value Filldown CONN_MODE (\S+)
Value Filldown VCID_EXT (\S+)
Value Filldown SIGNALING (\S+)
Value Filldown VC_TYPE (\S+)
Value Filldown LAST_CHANGE (\S+)
Value Filldown CREATE_TIME (.+?)
Value Filldown LOCAL_LABEL (\S+)
Value Filldown REMOTE_LABEL (\S+)
Value Filldown PW_NAME (\S+)
Value Filldown CONTROL_WORD (\S+)
Value Filldown ACTIVATION (\S+)
Value Filldown BANDWIDTH (.+?)
Value Filldown TUNNEL_DEST (\S+)
Value Filldown RELATED_IF (\S+)
Value Filldown FRR_TYPE (\S+)
Value Filldown VC_STATUS (\S+)
Value Filldown REMOTE_STATUS (\S+)
Value Filldown MC_SELECTION (\S+)
Value Filldown VCCV_CC (\S+)
Value VCCV_CV (\S+)

Start
  ^Service type and instance name:\[${SERVICE_INSTANCE}\]
  ^\s+Peer IP address\s+:\s+${PEER}\s+VCID\s+:\s+${VCID}\s*$$
  ^\s+Connection mode\s+:\s+${CONN_MODE}\s+VCID Extend\s+:\s+${VCID_EXT}\s*$$
  ^\s+Signaling protocol\s+:\s+${SIGNALING}\s+VC type\s+:\s+${VC_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^\s+Last status change time\s+:\s+${LAST_CHANGE}\s+Create time\s+:\s+${CREATE_TIME}\s*$$
  ^\s+MPLS VC local label\s+:\s+${LOCAL_LABEL}\s+Remote label\s+:\s+${REMOTE_LABEL}\s*$$
  ^\s+PW name\s+:\s+${PW_NAME}\s+Control Word\s+:\s+${CONTROL_WORD}\s*$$
  ^\s+Activation status\s+:\s+${ACTIVATION}\s*$$
  ^\s+Band Width\s+:\s+${BANDWIDTH}\s*$$
  ^\s+Tunnel destination\s+:\s+${TUNNEL_DEST}\s*$$
  ^\s+Related interface name\s+:\s+${RELATED_IF}\s*$$
  ^\s+FRR type\s+:\s+${FRR_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^\s+VC status\s+:\s+${VC_STATUS}\s*$$
  ^\s+Remote status\s+:\s+${REMOTE_STATUS}\s*$$
  ^\s+MC selection\s+:\s+${MC_SELECTION}\s*$$
  ^\s+VCCV CC type\s+:\s+${VCCV_CC}\s*$$
  ^\s+VCCV CV type\s+:\s+${VCCV_CV}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Headers:
  ^Codes
  ^PW count
  ^-+
  ^\s*$$
  ^\S+\s*#\s*$$ -> End
  ^.*#\s*$$ -> End
  ^.* -> Start
